// Supervisor (suggest) + D-097: once the verdict is `complete`, review the task's changes for bugs
// (five passes, majority vote, a check per finding) and follow up with what survives. It costs a
// continuation when it finds something, so read turns and wall-clock beside success, and compare
// hidden-check failures against `supervisor`: a reviewer that sends the agent after non-bugs shows
// up as success falling. Compare against `supervisor`.
{
	"modules": {
		"supervisor": { "enabled": true, "mode": "suggest", "review": true }
	}
}
